  "lessons": [
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-004-BE-NEGATIVE",
      "slug": "eng-a1-004-be-negative",
      "sortOrder": 10,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE", "ENG-A1-BE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-003-BE-AFFIRMATIVE"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "To be: inkor shakli",
        "description": "am not / isn't / aren't bilan biror narsa 'shunday emas' deyish.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBu darsda **to be** fe'lining **inkor** shakli bilan gap tuzishni o'rganasiz: biror narsa *shunday emas* deyishni." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida\n\nInkor uchun **to be** dan keyin **not** qo'shiladi:\n\n| Olmosh | Inkor | Qisqartma |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **I** | am not | I'm not |\n| **he / she / it** | is not | **isn't** |\n| **you / we / they** | are not | **aren't** |\n\n> **E'tibor bering:** standart ingliz tilida *amn't* ishlatilmaydi — buning o'rniga **I'm not** deyiladi." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- **I'm not** a teacher. I'm a student.\n- **She isn't** at home. She is at work.\n- **It isn't** cold today.\n- **They aren't** from Tashkent. They are from Andijan.\n- **We aren't** ready." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "He ___ at home. (u uyda emas)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "b", "text": "aren't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "am not" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Inkorda **not** ni tushirib qoldirmang va olmoshga mos shaklni tanlang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *He no is at home.* → To'g'ri: **He isn't at home.**\n> Noto'g'ri: *They isn't students.* → To'g'ri: **They aren't students.**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "They ___ ready. (ular tayyor emas)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "b", "text": "aren't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "am not" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "\"is not\" ning qisqartma shakli qaysi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "b", "text": "amn't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "aren't" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-NEGATIVE"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "I ___ from Tashkent. (men Toshkentdan emasman)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "am not" }, { "id": "b", "text": "isn't" }, { "id": "c", "text": "aren't" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- **I'm not**, **isn't** (he/she/it), **aren't** (you/we/they).\n- *amn't* yo'q — **I'm not** deyiladi." }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-005-BE-QUESTIONS",
      "slug": "eng-a1-005-be-questions",
      "sortOrder": 20,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-004-BE-NEGATIVE"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "To be bilan savollar",
        "description": "Are you...? Is he...? va What / Where / How old savollari.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBu darsda **to be** bilan savol berishni va tanishishda kerak bo'ladigan asosiy savollarni o'rganasiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 3,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qoida: fe'l oldinga chiqadi\n\nHa/yo'q savolida **to be** ega oldiga o'tadi:\n\n- You are a student. → **Are you** a student?\n- He is at home. → **Is he** at home?\n\n## Asosiy savollar\n\n| Savol | Ma'nosi |\n| --- | --- |\n| **What is your name?** | Isming(iz) nima? |\n| **Where are you from?** | Qayerdansiz? |\n| **How old are you?** | Necha yoshdasiz? |" }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "- **A:** What is your name? **B:** My name is Kamola.\n- **A:** Where are you from? **B:** I am from Fergana.\n- **A:** How old are you? **B:** I am nineteen.\n- **A:** Are you a student? **B:** Yes, I am.\n- **A:** Is he a teacher? **B:** No, he isn't." }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ you a student?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Are" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Is" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Am" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Qisqa javoblar\n\n- Are you a student? — **Yes, I am.** / **No, I'm not.**\n- Is she a doctor? — **Yes, she is.** / **No, she isn't.**\n\n> **Ko'p uchraydigan xato:** savolda *to be* ni tushirib qoldirmang.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *Where you from?* → To'g'ri: **Where are you from?**" }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "___ she from Bukhara?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "Is" }, { "id": "b", "text": "Are" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Am" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Kimningdir yoshini so'ramoqchisiz. Qaysi savol to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "How old are you?" }, { "id": "b", "text": "How old you are?" }, { "id": "c", "text": "How old is you?" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-BE-QUESTIONS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Kimningdir ismini so'ramoqchisiz. Qaysi savol to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "What is your name?" }, { "id": "b", "text": "What your name?" }, { "id": "c", "text": "Who is your name?" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- Savolda **to be** ega oldiga chiqadi: **Are you...?**, **Is he...?**\n- Asosiy savollar: **What is your name?**, **Where are you from?**, **How old are you?**" }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "contentKey": "ENG-A1-006-NUMBERS-PERSONAL-INFO",
      "slug": "eng-a1-006-numbers-personal-info",
      "sortOrder": 30,
      "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-NUMBERS", "ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
      "prerequisiteContentKeys": ["ENG-A1-005-BE-QUESTIONS"],
      "revision": {
        "title": "Sonlar va shaxsiy ma'lumot",
        "description": "0-100 sonlar, yosh va telefon raqamini aytish.",
        "activities": [
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Bugun nimani o'rganamiz?\n\nBu darsda **sonlar** (0-100) va oddiy **shaxsiy ma'lumot**ni aytishni o'rganasiz: yoshingiz va telefon raqamingiz." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 4,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Sonlar\n\n- **0-12** alohida yodlanadi: zero, one, two ... ten, eleven, twelve.\n- **13-19** oxirida **-teen**: thir**teen** (13), fif**teen** (15), nine**teen** (19).\n- **20-90** oxirida **-ty**: twen**ty** (20), thir**ty** (30), nine**ty** (90).\n- Qo'shma sonlar chiziqcha bilan: twenty-**one** (21), thirty-**five** (35).\n- **100** = one hundred.\n\n> **E'tibor bering:** **thirteen** (13) va **thirty** (30) — ikki xil son. -teen urg'usi oxirida, -ty urg'usi boshida." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Telefon raqami\n\nTelefon raqamlari **raqamma-raqam** (birma-bir) o'qiladi, bitta katta son sifatida emas.\n\n`4 7 2` → **four seven two** (\"four hundred seventy-two\" emas)." }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXAMPLE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "| Inglizcha | Ma'nosi |\n| --- | --- |\n| I am 20 years old. | Men 20 yoshdaman. |\n| I am from Uzbekistan. | Men O'zbekistondanman. |\n| My number is nine zero, one two three. | Raqamim 90-123. |" }
          },
          {
            "type": "MINI_QUESTION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Yoshingizni aytmoqchisiz: 25. Qaysi biri to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "I am 25 years old." }, { "id": "b", "text": "I have 25 years." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I am 25 year." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "EXPLANATION",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Ko'p uchraydigan xato\n\n> Yoshni aytishda *have* ishlatilmaydi.\n>\n> Noto'g'ri: *I have 25 years.* → To'g'ri: **I am 25 years old.**\n\nTelefon raqamini ham bitta katta son qilib o'qimang — har bir raqamni alohida ayting." }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-NUMBERS"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Telefon raqamidagi `4 7 2` qanday o'qiladi?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "four seven two" }, { "id": "b", "text": "forty-seven two" }, { "id": "c", "text": "four hundred seventy-two" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "PRACTICE",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "single_choice", "prompt": "Qayerdanligingizni ayting. Qaysi biri to'g'ri?", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "I am from Uzbekistan." }, { "id": "b", "text": "I from Uzbekistan." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I am from Uzbekistan country." } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "MASTERY_TEST",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 2,
            "skillCodes": ["ENG-A1-NUMBERS", "ENG-A1-PERSONAL-INFO"],
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-objective/v1", "format": "multiple_choice", "prompt": "Qaysi gaplar to'g'ri? (bir nechta javob bo'lishi mumkin)", "options": [ { "id": "a", "text": "forty-two = 42" }, { "id": "b", "text": "I am 25 years old." }, { "id": "c", "text": "I have 25 years." }, { "id": "d", "text": "one hundred = 10" } ], "answerKey": { "correctOptionIds": ["a", "b"] } }
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "estimatedDurationMin": 1,
            "payload": { "schemaVersion": "lesson-activity-markdown/v1", "markdown": "## Xulosa\n\n- 13-19 → **-teen**, 20-90 → **-ty**.\n- Yosh: **I am ... years old** (*have* emas).\n- Telefon: raqamma-raqam." }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
